{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In 1999, an interdimensional megalomaniac uses a skyscraper as a time travel vessel leaving behind a mini-black hole, distorting reality and a chunk of downtown. Welcome to that chunk of time and space.\u00a0<br><br>Armed with the ability to bend both time and space, you are a trained mercenary of an elite operative squad for hire known as &quot;The Agency&quot; known for efficient, and equally expensive, assignment fulfillment at any cost.\u00a0Parry, dodge, and sling bullets while chopping and skewing time in a race to your inevitable death - then wake up, and do it all over again. One day, you think, you won't die.\u00a0<br><br>Stuck within the Event Horizon, denizens of downtown as well as The Agency will provide you with randomized tools that you can unlock in subsequent runs. Gun attachments and other items will unlock as you gain cash and hack computers in minigames and improvisational choices. Face bosses and enemy variation that unlock as you progress. Water cooler humor, old school CRT's, that kinda thing.\u00a0 <br><br><strong>S K Y R I S E </strong> <br><strong> </strong> <br>Punch bullets.  <br>  <br>Stop time.  <br>  <br>Hack the mainframe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994250/extras/0b36140922c1ef12a77e6421e16d2ad4.avif?t=1774150607\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994250?t=1774150607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994250?t=1774150607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994250/f8a1668cb880c2ecf4e81bab7a36718c2266a575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774150607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s